{"data": {"Vex": {"allytips": [], "blurb": "In the black heart of the Shadow Isles, a lone yordle trudges through the spectral fog, content in its murky misery. With an endless supply of teen angst and a powerful shadow in tow, Vex lives in her own self-made slice of gloom, far from the revolting...", "enemytips": [], "id": "Vex", "image": {"full": "Vex.png", "group": "champion", "h": 48, "sprite": "champion5.png", "w": 48, "x": 0, "y": 0}, "info": {"attack": 0, "defense": 0, "difficulty": 0, "magic": 0}, "key": "711", "lore": "In the black heart of the Shadow Isles, a lone yordle trudges through the spectral fog, content in its murky misery. With an endless supply of teen angst and a powerful shadow in tow, Vex lives in her own self-made slice of gloom, far from the revolting cheer of the “normie” world. Though she lacks ambition, she is quick to strike down color and happiness, stopping all would-be interlopers with her magical malaise.", "name": "Vex", "partype": "Mana", "passive": {"description": "Vex periodically becomes empowered, causing her next basic Ability to fear enemies and interrupt dashes. Whenever a nearby enemy dashes, Vex applies a mark that can be consumed for bonus damage that also reduces the cooldown of her empowered state.", "image": {"full": "Icons_Vex_Passive.png", "group": "passive", "h": 48, "sprite": "passive5.png", "w": 48, "x": 0, "y": 0}, "name": "Doom 'n Gloom"}, "recommended": [], "skins": [{"chromas": false, "id": "711000", "name": "default", "num": 0}, {"chromas": true, "id": "711001", "name": "Dawnbringer Vex", "num": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "711002", "name": "Dawnbringer Vex (Ruby)", "num": 2, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "711003", "name": "Dawnbringer Vex (Sapphire)", "num": 3, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "711004", "name": "Dawnbringer Vex (Catseye)", "num": 4, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "711005", "name": "Dawnbringer Vex (Emerald)", "num": 5, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false,